  <h1>🌱 Healthy Living Guide</h1>
  <p>Healthy habits can improve your physical and mental well-being every day.</p>

  <h2>Eat Nutritious Food</h2>
  <p>A balanced diet provides the nutrients your body needs to function properly and stay energetic.</p>

  <h2>Stay Active</h2>
  <p>Regular exercise helps strengthen muscles, improve heart health, and reduce stress.</p>

  <h3>Simple Activities</h3>
  <p>Walking, cycling, swimming, and stretching are easy ways to stay active throughout the week.</p>

  <h2>Get Enough Sleep</h2>
  <p>Quality sleep helps the body recover and supports learning, memory, and concentration.</p>

